/**
 * DEMO DATA ADAPTER. Answers the same REST contract as apps/api from memory, so the unchanged
 * production screens run without any service. Data is illustrative; nothing is generated by AI.
 * Default contract = the official one ("single_piece_try_on": consented photo, one catalog piece,
 * versions). `?demo=full` keeps the earlier prompt-based prototype (Procurar/Vestir, Match).
 */
